# Loose rivet scratch dropped in the repo ROOT (ee2c831: "dist/ and loose
# yaml"). These MUST stay anchored with a leading `/`: unanchored, git matches
# the basename at any depth, so `tools/fixtures/*/requirements.yaml` was
# silently excluded — `git add <dir>` skips it and still exits 0. The tracked
# artifacts/ and safety/stpa/ copies were unaffected only because gitignore
# does not apply to already-tracked files.
/architecture.yaml
/requirements.yaml
/verification.yaml

